        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[60:9]  GOD enjoins you only from befriending those who fight you because of religion, evict you from your homes, and band together with others to banish you. You shall not befriend them. Those who befriend them are the transgressors.",
      "start": 205.42,
      "end": 218.84,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
