      "end": 1221.82,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " In",
          "start": 1220.16,
          "end": 1220.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Sura",
          "start": 1220.16,
          "end": 1220.26,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " 17,",
          "start": 1220.26,
          "end": 1220.51,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 1221.06,
          "end": 1221.06,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " says,",
          "start": 1221.06,
          "end": 1221.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(17:44) \u0648\u064e\u0625\u0650\u0646 \u0645\u0651\u0650\u0646 \u0634\u064e\u0649\u0652\u0621\u064d \u0625\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0627 \u064a\u064f\u0633\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650\u062d\u064f \u0628\u0650\u062d\u064e\u0645\u0652\u062f\u0650\u0647\u0650\u06e6",
      "start": 1221.84,
      "end": 1223.68,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " (17:44)",
          "start": 1221.84,
          "end": 1221.84,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0648\u064e\u0625\u0650\u0646",
          "start": 1221.84,
          "end": 1221.98,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0645\u0651\u0650\u0646",
          "start": 1221.98,
          "end": 1222.08,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0634\u064e\u0649\u0652\u0621\u064d",
          "start": 1222.08,
          "end": 1222.44,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0625\u0650\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0627",
          "start": 1222.44,
          "end": 1222.74,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u064a\u064f\u0633\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650\u062d\u064f",
          "start": 1222.74,
          "end": 1223.14,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " \u0628\u0650\u062d\u064e\u0645\u0652\u062f\u0650\u0647\u0650\u06e6",
          "start": 1223.14,
          "end": 1223.68,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There is nothing that does not glorify God.",
      "start": 1223.68,
      "end": 1225.78,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " There",
          "start": 1223.68,
          "end": 1223.68,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 1223.68,
          "end": 1223.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " nothing",
          "start": 1223.86,
          "end": 1224.2,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " that",
          "start": 1224.2,
          "end": 1224.38,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " does",
          "start": 1224.38,
          "end": 1224.56,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 1224.56,
          "end": 1224.74,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " glorify",
          "start": 1224.74,
          "end": 1225.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God.",
          "start": 1225.22,
          "end": 1225.78,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Even the disbelievers.",
      "start": 1226.68,
      "end": 1227.47,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Even",
          "start": 1226.68,
          "end": 1226.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 1226.86,
          "end": 1227.02,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " disbelievers.",
          "start": 1227.02,
          "end": 1227.47,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And the rest of the verse here says \"we do not understand their glorification.\"",
      "start": 1228.86,
      "end": 1232.98,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
